        "notes": "Vorderseite des Notizbuchs, blauer Einband mit goldener Prägung.",
        "type": "content"
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "transcription": "FLEXOR\nNOTES\nNo. F103\n\nCompanion Books—\nFLEXOR INDEX No. F123\nFLEXOR ENGAGEMENTS No. F133\nFLEXOR REMINDER No. F143\n\nMade in England.",
        "notes": "Innenseite des vorderen Buchdeckels, gedruckter Text.",
        "type": "content"
      },
      {
        "page": 3,
        "transcription": "A new interior for this Book\nmay be obtained by ordering\nWALKER'S FLEXOR REFILL\n(GUMMED BACK)\nNo. F213 NOTES\n\nSOCIETY\nSTATIONERY\n\nLONDON:\nJOHN WALKER & Co. LTD.\nFARRINGDON HOUSE, WARWICK LANE,\nE.C. 4.",
        "notes": "Erste Innenseite, gedruckter Text.",
        "type": "content"
      },
      {
        "page": 4,
        "transcription": "Langham 3693\nSpearwell 8631\n\nB 15552\nXIX Leopoldstera[?] 11\n\nFray 24893",
